// Provenance §194: free choice of childcare supplement (CMG, wave 3).
// The fragment block below is generated by tools/sync_pf_cmg_fragments.py
// from the pinned bytes of sources/fr-pf-cmg/*.txt (accounted in
// articles.json, version XML in sources/fr-pf-cmg/legi/ and
