// .scratch/legi/mirror/{LEGITEXT000006073189,JORFTEXT000051714519,
// JORFTEXT000051714530}, snapshot 2026-10-06). Do not edit by hand.
//
// Package window (phase 0): [2021-01-01, infinity) — technical plan window
// (§4.3). Editions back-to-back from the start of coverage; the reform of
// 01.09.2025 (decrees 2025-514/515 applying art. 86 of law 2022-1616)
// splits most wordings, shared residence opens 01.12.2025.
//
// Why FORTY-ONE documents for eighteen numbers. L. 531-5: pre-reform,
// reform, then the 2025-12-31 wording carrying the III-6°
// severance-indemnity exclusion (law 2025-1403). The 2026-01-01 V-bis
// wording (non-payment suspension, law 2025-199 art. 92) is recorded
// MODIFIE_MORT_NE in LEGI — dead-born, never in force, NOT pinned
// (D-16). L. 531-6: five wordings (tiers-payant 09.2024–02.2025, EAJE
// tariff-scope precision 01.2025, reform 09.2025). L. 531-8-1 (FINISH
// paje-cmg): 2019 wording, 2021-12-25 wording (I-paragraph reference).
// L. 531-9 (FINISH paje-cmg): 2014 wording, 2025-09-01 wording
// (reduction restricted to the L. 531-6 aid), 2025-12-31 wording
// (daily-allowance non-cumulation). D. 531-17: three.
// D. 531-18: old scale, reform formula. D. 531-18-1: old ceilings twice,
// then the NEW age article (<6, 12 for isolated parents). D. 531-18-2:
// shared residence from 01.12.2025. D. 531-18-3: L.531-5 cumulation.
// D. 531-19: old list, 2026-07-01 wording. D. 531-20/21/22/23: old, reform.
// R. 531-5: single. R. 531-6: three (RSA insertion via France Travail
// registration from 13.06.2025, decree 2025-514). Decrees: 2025-514
// arts 2–3, 2025-515 arts 3–6 (transitional differential, dates).
//
// Old D. 531-18-1 ED2022 carries a TRANSFERE flag with fin 2025-06-13
// while the reform replaces it 2025-09-01: the edition is kept continuous
// [@2022-01-01, @2025-09-01), the flag is recorded, no gap is invented.
//
// D. 531-18-1/18-2/18-3 and R. 531-5/6 are PENDING_WAVE in INVENTORY.json
// (outside the ownership table): claimed for this package by D-16,
// recorded in the W3-PFCMG HANDOFF section, pending coordinator
