// base (fr.pf.paje, wave 3); L. 512-1/L. 512-3/L. 513-1 charge and
// allocataire status, BMAF, N-2 resources (fr.pf.core); SMIC series
// (fr.travail.smic); R. 2324-46 EAJE capacity and R. 2324-1 tariff scope
